                    "ontology": null,
                    "documentation": "WHAT knob this is. To be BOUND (not yet declared -- binding worksheet, 2026-09-25), and UNIQUE within the list. Identity lives in a bound variable, so domain-specific knobs are DATA rather than schema and no class or field is minted per program. A knob with no ontology term is a LABEL ({name}, no node; item 33), so every setting fits this list and nothing needs an untyped bag. The entry has the same shape as a key or a condition entry.",
                    "constraints": {
